    "message": "Move validation tooling into the repo; rewrite the agent brief\n\nThe LSP capture runner, source/provider guards, build finaliser,\ntargeted runner, report writer and CI job summariser lived only in a\nsession scratch directory. They now live in\ndocs/work/name-handling/validation-tools/ with paths found via git and\na git-ignored work directory; capture.sh wraps the guarded build and\n1,085-selector capture, extracting the pinned selection manifests from\nthe checkpoint09 archive. continue-prompt.md is now the brief for an\nagent that runs validations and keeps current-state.md current.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011NdtTupEa77wLeefhZZXA7",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-21T14:18:21Z",
